==Tips==
Due to the increased growth rate, chopping down a fruit tree as soon as it would produce a silver sapling and replanting that sapling on the same day, will result in the tree producing iridium quality fruit more than a full season sooner than a tree planted at the same time that is not cut down and replanted.

==Bugs==
*It should be possible to plant a [[Trees|common tree]] seed (''i.e.,'' [[Acorn]], [[Mahogany Seed]], [[Maple Seed]], or [[Pine Cone]]) and a Fruit Tree sapling (in either order) two tiles away from each other. A bug prevents the player from planting a common tree seed exactly two tiles away from an existing Fruit Tree sapling and from planting a Fruit Tree sapling two tiles away from a common tree seed. The common tree seed is treated as though it were another Fruit Tree sapling.

*Shaking a Cherry Tree planted inside the [[Greenhouse]] during spring may produce pink leaves falling down, even though the tree itself is displayed in its green, summer variant.

